1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:02:24,145 --> 00:02:25,185
This smell...

3
00:02:27,785 --> 00:02:29,385
is exactly the same as twenty years ago.

4
00:02:41,785 --> 00:02:42,665
Ling Yunfei.

5
00:02:43,865 --> 00:02:45,225
Are you going to talk or not?

6
00:03:03,425 --> 00:03:04,425
I, Ling Yunfei,

7
00:03:05,665 --> 00:03:07,105
hate informers more than anything.

8
00:03:13,425 --> 00:03:14,345
Execute him.

9
00:03:16,425 --> 00:03:21,985
-Kill him!
-Kill him!

10
00:03:28,385 --> 00:03:31,225
-Good!
-Good!

11
00:03:32,065 --> 00:03:33,305
Good riddance!

12
00:03:37,425 --> 00:03:38,625
The traitor has been executed.

13
00:03:39,305 --> 00:03:40,825
Let's report back to His Majesty.

14
00:03:45,065 --> 00:03:47,545
Meng Tinghui fulfilled her
military pledge on time

15
00:03:47,625 --> 00:03:48,945
and destroyed the Tiger's Roar Gang.

16
00:03:49,025 --> 00:03:50,105
She has not disappointed me.

17
00:03:50,185 --> 00:03:51,505
As for the rest,

18
00:03:51,585 --> 00:03:52,865
proceed as you proposed.

19
00:03:54,225 --> 00:03:55,785
I obey.

20
00:03:55,865 --> 00:03:56,705
Shen Zhishu.

21
00:03:56,785 --> 00:03:57,785
At your service.

22
00:03:59,825 --> 00:04:01,305
In capturing the Tiger's Roar Gang

23
00:04:01,385 --> 00:04:03,745
and investigating the Blood Moon Society,
you rendered repeated service.

24
00:04:03,825 --> 00:04:06,425
I hereby promote you
to fourth-rank Censor.

25
00:04:06,505 --> 00:04:07,785
You will take charge of the
Blood Moon Society case.

26
00:04:07,865 --> 00:04:09,385
I also grant you a
frontier mobilization order

27
00:04:09,465 --> 00:04:10,465
to reinforce Qingzhou.

28
00:04:10,545 --> 00:04:12,185
If you find proof of treason,

29
00:04:12,945 --> 00:04:14,345
you may execute first
and report afterward.

30
00:04:18,025 --> 00:04:19,185
I thank Your Majesty for this great favor.

31
00:04:19,265 --> 00:04:20,585
I will devote myself completely

32
00:04:20,665 --> 00:04:22,025
and not fail Your Majesty.

33
00:04:22,105 --> 00:04:22,945
Rise.

34
00:04:24,785 --> 00:04:26,665
Your Majesty, I have
completed my investigation.

35
00:04:26,745 --> 00:04:28,505
The Blood Moon Society,
founded by Zhongwan loyalists,

36
00:04:28,585 --> 00:04:29,545
has operated under the
cover of Huiyin House

37
00:04:29,625 --> 00:04:30,505
and lain hidden in the capital for years,

38
00:04:30,585 --> 00:04:32,585
drawing many high officials
and nobles to its side.

39
00:04:32,665 --> 00:04:34,905
Its ambition to restore Zhongwan is plain.

40
00:04:34,985 --> 00:04:36,425
We are now pursuing its remaining members.

41
00:04:36,505 --> 00:04:37,345
Your Majesty.

42
00:04:38,185 --> 00:04:40,705
I once campaigned against
Zhongwan with the late Emperor.

43
00:04:40,785 --> 00:04:42,145
I beg Your Majesty

44
00:04:42,225 --> 00:04:43,305
to let me lead elite troops

45
00:04:43,385 --> 00:04:45,185
and eradicate the remnants of Zhongwan.

46
00:04:45,265 --> 00:04:46,625
At my age,

47
00:04:46,705 --> 00:04:49,505
if I can die in battle
serving Your Majesty,

48
00:04:49,585 --> 00:04:50,785
I will have no regrets.

49
00:04:50,865 --> 00:04:52,625
Blindly suppressing them by force

50
00:04:52,705 --> 00:04:54,225
will only deepen the hatred.

51
00:04:54,305 --> 00:04:57,385
Besides, Qingzhou's northern
border adjoins Beijian.

52
00:04:57,465 --> 00:04:58,865
If that sparks both internal
and external unrest,

53
00:04:59,585 --> 00:05:01,585
the people will be the ones who suffer.

54
00:05:01,665 --> 00:05:03,345
Your Majesty sees far ahead.

55
00:05:03,425 --> 00:05:04,465
According to my investigation,

56
00:05:05,025 --> 00:05:06,145
the Beijian royal court once proposed

57
00:05:06,225 --> 00:05:08,145
jointly mining Wanshan iron
ore near Qingzhou's border.

58
00:05:08,225 --> 00:05:10,225
If Beijian joins forces
with the Blood Moon Society,

59
00:05:10,305 --> 00:05:11,305
the consequences could be grave.

60
00:05:16,625 --> 00:05:17,705
Your Majesty.

61
00:05:18,465 --> 00:05:19,305
I have a plan.

62
00:05:19,385 --> 00:05:20,945
It requires no large military campaign

63
00:05:21,025 --> 00:05:22,105
and could eliminate the foreign threat.

64
00:05:30,145 --> 00:05:31,185
Your Majesty.

65
00:05:31,665 --> 00:05:33,105
Beijian has sent a marriage proposal.

66
00:05:33,185 --> 00:05:34,625
They wish to send their
Divine Maiden for an alliance.

67
00:05:34,705 --> 00:05:37,105
The Divine Maiden of Beijian
understands the stars

68
00:05:37,185 --> 00:05:38,585
and can even divine a nation's fortunes.

69
00:05:38,665 --> 00:05:39,865
Her status is exalted.

70
00:05:39,945 --> 00:05:41,385
If this marriage takes place,

71
00:05:41,465 --> 00:05:42,905
relations between our two
states will be secured.

72
00:05:42,985 --> 00:05:45,185
Then even if the Blood Moon
Society harbors ambition,

73
00:05:45,265 --> 00:05:47,345
it cannot use Beijian to stir up trouble.

74
00:05:47,425 --> 00:05:48,265
Absurd!

75
00:05:49,305 --> 00:05:51,385
The Empress's seat in Daning

76
00:05:51,465 --> 00:05:52,905
cannot be occupied by a foreign woman.

77
00:05:52,985 --> 00:05:55,145
Beijian masses troops at our border

78
00:05:55,225 --> 00:05:56,745
while sending envoys to propose marriage.

79
00:05:56,825 --> 00:05:59,385
Is that sincerity or a threat?

80
00:06:00,145 --> 00:06:01,265
Your Majesty.

81
00:06:01,345 --> 00:06:04,025
If a marriage alliance buys ten
years of peace on the border,

82
00:06:04,105 --> 00:06:05,425
it is not a bad strategy.

83
00:06:05,505 --> 00:06:08,025
Daning and Beijian already
have a trade treaty.

84
00:06:08,665 --> 00:06:10,665
Why seek peace through marriage as well?

85
00:06:11,185 --> 00:06:12,705
Peace between nations

86
00:06:12,785 --> 00:06:14,625
rests on strength.

87
00:06:14,705 --> 00:06:16,345
Your Majesty is absolutely right.

88
00:06:16,425 --> 00:06:17,865
When the Emperor of Daning
appoints an Empress,

89
00:06:17,945 --> 00:06:19,745
the court ministers must make nominations.

90
00:06:19,825 --> 00:06:22,425
The Empress's seat has
remained vacant too long,

91
00:06:22,505 --> 00:06:24,145
which has invited Beijian's designs.

92
00:06:24,225 --> 00:06:26,225
I beg Your Majesty

93
00:06:26,305 --> 00:06:27,905
to appoint an Empress as soon as possible

94
00:06:27,985 --> 00:06:30,385
and end those barbarians' delusions.

95
00:06:30,465 --> 00:06:33,145
Beijian's ruler has already
sent envoys to seek a marriage.

96
00:06:33,225 --> 00:06:34,385
If we mishandle this,

97
00:06:34,465 --> 00:06:35,425
it may bring trouble to the border.

98
00:06:36,145 --> 00:06:37,865
My two ministers, enough arguing.

99
00:06:37,945 --> 00:06:39,465
I will consider the matter carefully.

100
00:06:40,305 --> 00:06:41,145
Meng Tinghui.

101
00:06:44,425 --> 00:06:46,465
About the memorial you just submitted,

102
00:06:46,545 --> 00:06:48,625
I still have one comment.

103
00:06:48,705 --> 00:06:49,545
Take a look

104
00:06:50,065 --> 00:06:51,065
and see if anything is unclear.

105
00:06:58,385 --> 00:06:59,785
Regarding the marriage alliance,

106
00:06:59,865 --> 00:07:01,705
Beijian may be willing, but I am not.

107
00:07:02,745 --> 00:07:04,465
There is only one person in my heart—you.

108
00:07:07,225 --> 00:07:08,145
Your Majesty.

109
00:07:09,065 --> 00:07:09,905
I understand.

110
00:07:10,745 --> 00:07:12,225
-Your Majesty...
-Enough.

111
00:07:12,305 --> 00:07:13,745
All of you may withdraw.

112
00:07:14,785 --> 00:07:15,985
Meng Tinghui, you stay.

113
00:07:16,945 --> 00:07:18,705
-I take my leave.
-I take my leave.

114
00:07:44,545 --> 00:07:46,785
-About just now...
-Your Majesty.

115
00:07:48,785 --> 00:07:49,865
Your Majesty.

116
00:07:49,945 --> 00:07:52,105
This old servant has an
urgent matter to report.

117
00:07:52,185 --> 00:07:53,425
What is it?

118
00:07:53,945 --> 00:07:55,425
Your Majesty has been on
the throne for three years

119
00:07:55,505 --> 00:07:56,545
and is still unmarried.

120
00:07:56,625 --> 00:07:57,745
Appointing an Empress and consorts

121
00:07:57,825 --> 00:07:59,905
is a matter of state and
the foundation of the realm.

122
00:07:59,985 --> 00:08:02,225
Your Majesty, if you do not
want this marriage alliance,

123
00:08:02,305 --> 00:08:05,225
I can select several more

124
00:08:05,305 --> 00:08:06,945
noble ladies of both beauty and talent...

125
00:08:07,025 --> 00:08:08,465
Are you trying to make me
run away from the palace?

126
00:08:08,545 --> 00:08:09,705
I would never dare.

127
00:08:09,785 --> 00:08:10,945
Leave.

128
00:08:11,625 --> 00:08:12,865
I'll withdraw at once.

129
00:08:23,265 --> 00:08:24,625
Were you angry just now?

130
00:08:24,705 --> 00:08:26,105
Jealous, perhaps?

131
00:08:27,945 --> 00:08:29,185
Of course not.

132
00:08:29,265 --> 00:08:31,545
Your Majesty is ruler of the realm.

133
00:08:31,625 --> 00:08:33,865
If I grew jealous of every woman you met,

134
00:08:34,385 --> 00:08:35,505
I fear I would overstep my place.

135
00:08:40,985 --> 00:08:42,345
You are overstepping.

136
00:08:43,785 --> 00:08:45,025
But I like it.

137
00:08:50,025 --> 00:08:50,945
Your Majesty.

138
00:08:53,585 --> 00:08:54,825
Your Majesty.

139
00:08:54,905 --> 00:08:55,825
What are you afraid of?

140
00:08:57,185 --> 00:08:59,545
The courage you had that day
in Wangxian Valley—

141
00:08:59,625 --> 00:09:00,865
where did it go?

142
00:09:00,945 --> 00:09:01,865
Your Majesty.

143
00:09:08,065 --> 00:09:09,505
Please restrain yourself.

144
00:09:35,865 --> 00:09:36,705
Zhili.

145
00:09:36,785 --> 00:09:38,745
I'm going to Qingzhou on
an imperial assignment,

146
00:09:38,825 --> 00:09:39,785
not being exiled to the far north.

147
00:09:39,865 --> 00:09:41,025
If you pack this much for me,

148
00:09:41,105 --> 00:09:42,345
won't people laugh at me?

149
00:09:43,465 --> 00:09:44,825
Qingzhou is bitterly cold.

150
00:09:44,905 --> 00:09:47,025
Frost in the sixth month
is nothing unusual.

151
00:09:47,625 --> 00:09:48,465
Brother.

152
00:09:48,545 --> 00:09:51,825
You always care more about
appearances than warmth.

153
00:09:51,905 --> 00:09:53,425
But this trip is for serious business.

154
00:09:53,505 --> 00:09:55,665
Forget looking elegant for once.

155
00:09:55,745 --> 00:09:57,305
Taking care of yourself matters most.

156
00:09:57,385 --> 00:09:59,105
You've thought of everything.

157
00:09:59,185 --> 00:10:00,225
You're starting to sound
like my older sister.

158
00:10:00,865 --> 00:10:01,825
Fine by me.

159
00:10:01,905 --> 00:10:03,545
Then call me Sister from now on.

160
00:10:04,345 --> 00:10:06,065
No, thanks. Anian is your
one good little brother.

161
00:10:07,745 --> 00:10:08,865
I wouldn't dare compete with him.

162
00:10:09,825 --> 00:10:11,065
Don't take anything else out.

163
00:10:11,145 --> 00:10:12,785
I'll see how Father's
meal is coming along.

164
00:10:12,865 --> 00:10:13,825
I'll call you when it's ready.

165
00:10:20,425 --> 00:10:21,705
Brother.

166
00:10:23,425 --> 00:10:24,825
Let your little brother
say one more thing.

167
00:10:24,905 --> 00:10:26,665
The border is nothing like the capital.

168
00:10:26,745 --> 00:10:28,305
You'll be out there alone.

169
00:10:28,385 --> 00:10:30,185
Open attacks are easy to dodge;
hidden ones are not.

170
00:10:30,265 --> 00:10:31,105
So

171
00:10:31,185 --> 00:10:32,945
I prepared this especially for you.

172
00:10:34,745 --> 00:10:35,785
You must wear it at all times.

173
00:10:38,385 --> 00:10:39,865
Fine. Put it in for me.

174
00:10:40,825 --> 00:10:41,945
I know you too well.

175
00:10:42,785 --> 00:10:43,785
You agree readily to my face,

176
00:10:43,865 --> 00:10:45,425
then forget the moment you turn around.

177
00:10:45,505 --> 00:10:46,665
Today,

178
00:10:46,745 --> 00:10:48,185
I'm putting it on you myself.

179
00:10:49,585 --> 00:10:50,745
Mind your manners.

180
00:10:51,705 --> 00:10:53,505
I'm already spoken for.

181
00:10:53,585 --> 00:10:54,905
I have to preserve my virtue for Fuzhi.

182
00:10:55,745 --> 00:10:56,625
Fine.

183
00:10:56,705 --> 00:10:59,385
Spoken for, preserving your virtue.

184
00:10:59,465 --> 00:11:00,785
I'll leave it right here.

185
00:11:02,545 --> 00:11:03,385
Anian.

186
00:11:04,465 --> 00:11:05,625
Before I leave,

187
00:11:07,545 --> 00:11:08,865
there are some things I need to tell you.

188
00:11:11,265 --> 00:11:13,785
I don't know when I'll return.

189
00:11:13,865 --> 00:11:15,305
What worries me most

190
00:11:15,385 --> 00:11:16,465
is this family.

191
00:11:17,105 --> 00:11:18,265
Father and Mother are getting old.

192
00:11:18,825 --> 00:11:20,225
Zhili is still unmarried.

193
00:11:20,305 --> 00:11:21,985
You must take good care of them for me,

194
00:11:22,065 --> 00:11:23,505
especially Zhili.

195
00:11:23,585 --> 00:11:24,745
Don't worry, Brother.

196
00:11:24,825 --> 00:11:26,025
I'll protect her.

197
00:11:26,985 --> 00:11:28,265
Protection alone isn't enough.

198
00:11:28,345 --> 00:11:30,345
Those feelings you have for Zhili...

199
00:11:30,425 --> 00:11:31,545
I noticed them long ago.

200
00:11:31,625 --> 00:11:32,465
I...

201
00:11:33,105 --> 00:11:35,025
You don't need to hide anything from me.

202
00:11:41,065 --> 00:11:43,185
Zhili grew up with you from childhood.

203
00:11:43,265 --> 00:11:44,785
The way she cares about you

204
00:11:44,865 --> 00:11:47,265
even exceeds how she cares
for me, her own brother.

205
00:11:47,345 --> 00:11:48,385
I can see that too.

206
00:11:48,465 --> 00:11:49,825
You brat, you're no innocent.

207
00:11:49,905 --> 00:11:51,825
You set your sights on our Zhili long ago.

208
00:11:53,625 --> 00:11:54,585
But

209
00:11:55,665 --> 00:11:56,945
if I entrust Zhili to you,

210
00:11:58,785 --> 00:11:59,945
I can rest easy.

211
00:12:07,465 --> 00:12:09,425
I have told her how I feel.

212
00:12:10,305 --> 00:12:11,425
But in her heart...

213
00:12:11,505 --> 00:12:12,545
Don't worry.

214
00:12:13,105 --> 00:12:14,385
Whatever there is between
her and the Right Chancellor

215
00:12:14,465 --> 00:12:16,265
is no more than a student's

216
00:12:16,345 --> 00:12:18,025
admiration and respect for her teacher.

217
00:12:18,105 --> 00:12:20,345
It is not romantic love.

218
00:12:20,905 --> 00:12:22,625
Even you know about this?

219
00:12:23,385 --> 00:12:24,505
There are some things

220
00:12:25,065 --> 00:12:26,465
I wanted to tell her myself.

221
00:12:27,105 --> 00:12:28,505
But somehow,

222
00:12:28,585 --> 00:12:30,185
between brother and sister,

223
00:12:30,265 --> 00:12:31,665
some subjects are hard to bring up.

224
00:12:33,385 --> 00:12:34,505
While I'm away,

225
00:12:34,585 --> 00:12:36,145
you must keep an eye on her for me.

226
00:12:36,225 --> 00:12:37,825
Don't let the Right Chancellor mislead her

227
00:12:37,905 --> 00:12:38,745
and lead her astray.

228
00:12:39,585 --> 00:12:40,585
Because of the Right Chancellor,

229
00:12:41,265 --> 00:12:42,865
we've had many arguments.

230
00:12:44,065 --> 00:12:45,225
Even now...

231
00:12:45,745 --> 00:12:46,905
she keeps avoiding me.

232
00:12:47,505 --> 00:12:48,625
You, of all people,

233
00:12:49,225 --> 00:12:50,665
are carefree and unrestrained all day,

234
00:12:50,745 --> 00:12:52,545
yet around Zhili you're
always so cautious.

235
00:12:53,425 --> 00:12:54,745
You value her too much,

236
00:12:54,825 --> 00:12:56,425
so you overthink every move.

237
00:12:56,505 --> 00:12:58,065
When it comes to love,

238
00:12:58,745 --> 00:13:00,665
you need a little reckless courage.

239
00:13:00,745 --> 00:13:02,145
Otherwise, once you miss your chance,

240
00:13:02,225 --> 00:13:03,385
you may regret it for life.

241
00:13:05,745 --> 00:13:06,745
Besides,

242
00:13:07,505 --> 00:13:08,905
you're young and in your prime,

243
00:13:08,985 --> 00:13:10,225
with a bright future ahead.

244
00:13:10,305 --> 00:13:11,425
How are you inferior to
the Right Chancellor?

245
00:13:11,505 --> 00:13:13,105
Even if we take the worst-case view,

246
00:13:13,185 --> 00:13:14,585
you're more than twenty
years younger than he is.

247
00:13:15,385 --> 00:13:16,225
As for my future brother-in-law,

248
00:13:16,305 --> 00:13:17,625
you're the only one I'll accept.

249
00:13:17,705 --> 00:13:19,225
I understand.

250
00:13:19,305 --> 00:13:20,465
When it comes to Zhili,

251
00:13:20,545 --> 00:13:21,865
I won't yield even an inch.

252
00:13:32,665 --> 00:13:33,505
That must be Father's...

253
00:13:33,585 --> 00:13:34,465
sweet-and-sour ribs.

254
00:13:34,545 --> 00:13:35,425
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

255
00:13:35,505 --> 00:13:36,345
Stop pushing me.

256
00:13:36,425 --> 00:13:39,305
His Majesty has permitted
Bofeng Tavern to reopen.

257
00:13:39,385 --> 00:13:41,345
Fine dishes await every guest.

258
00:13:41,425 --> 00:13:43,545
All wine is half price.

259
00:13:43,625 --> 00:13:45,425
-Please come in!
-Please come in!

260
00:13:46,505 --> 00:13:47,625
Sir, right this way.

261
00:13:51,185 --> 00:13:52,665
The Blood Moon Society
operates in secrecy.

262
00:13:52,745 --> 00:13:53,585
On this trip,

263
00:13:53,665 --> 00:13:54,945
you must be extremely careful.

264
00:13:55,025 --> 00:13:56,185
If anything unusual happens,

265
00:13:56,265 --> 00:13:57,625
send word back immediately.

266
00:13:59,025 --> 00:14:00,065
I have the imperial order with me.

267
00:14:00,145 --> 00:14:01,265
Your Majesty needn't worry.

268
00:14:04,105 --> 00:14:06,505
Director Meng even made
pastries herself to see me off.

269
00:14:06,585 --> 00:14:08,265
I'm truly moved by such affection.

270
00:14:09,785 --> 00:14:11,145
Who said they were made for you?

271
00:14:12,225 --> 00:14:14,065
Director Meng and I
were chatting last night

272
00:14:14,145 --> 00:14:15,745
and mentioned this thousand-layer cake.

273
00:14:15,825 --> 00:14:17,105
Last night?

274
00:14:17,825 --> 00:14:18,865
I entered the palace last night

275
00:14:18,945 --> 00:14:21,105
to report my itinerary to Your Majesty.

276
00:14:21,185 --> 00:14:22,465
I never saw Director Meng there.

277
00:14:24,585 --> 00:14:25,465
Lord Shen,

278
00:14:25,545 --> 00:14:27,385
isn't Fuzhi here to see you off?

279
00:14:27,465 --> 00:14:28,305
Zhizhi.

280
00:14:28,385 --> 00:14:29,985
I brought some loose silver and banknotes.

281
00:14:30,065 --> 00:14:31,985
-Zhizhi.
-And withdrawal seals for Yan banks.

282
00:14:32,065 --> 00:14:34,705
Zhizhi, you're far too good to me.

283
00:14:34,785 --> 00:14:36,945
We'll have a long, tiring journey.

284
00:14:37,025 --> 00:14:38,465
We can't exactly make
ourselves suffer, can we?

285
00:14:38,545 --> 00:14:39,585
We?

286
00:14:40,465 --> 00:14:41,305
Zhizhi.

287
00:14:41,385 --> 00:14:43,025
I'm going this time on official business.

288
00:14:43,105 --> 00:14:44,105
What a coincidence, then.

289
00:14:44,185 --> 00:14:45,945
His Majesty has allowed
Bofeng Tavern to reopen.

290
00:14:46,025 --> 00:14:47,705
Merchants from every prefecture
have sent calling cards.

291
00:14:47,785 --> 00:14:49,585
The head of the Qingzhou
Merchants' Guild sent three.

292
00:14:49,665 --> 00:14:52,305
I have to inspect things there in person.

293
00:14:57,065 --> 00:14:57,905
Zhizhi.

294
00:14:57,985 --> 00:15:00,185
I'm going on a confidential mission.

295
00:15:00,265 --> 00:15:01,585
You can use visiting relatives
as a pretext

296
00:15:01,665 --> 00:15:02,985
and travel with Miss Yan.

297
00:15:03,825 --> 00:15:04,945
it will help conceal your movements.

298
00:15:05,945 --> 00:15:06,785
-Wonderful!
-Wonderful!

299
00:15:06,865 --> 00:15:09,065
Zhizhi, let's switch
to a roomier carriage.

300
00:15:09,145 --> 00:15:10,065
We'll line it with snow-fox blankets.

301
00:15:10,145 --> 00:15:11,505
and bring your favorite pastries.

302
00:15:11,585 --> 00:15:13,585
Zhizhi, you're so thoughtful.

303
00:15:13,665 --> 00:15:15,305
Zhizhi, you're still the best.

304
00:15:15,385 --> 00:15:17,945
No, no. You're much better.

305
00:15:18,505 --> 00:15:19,785
No, you are.

306
00:15:21,585 --> 00:15:22,865
What are you two doing?

307
00:15:24,065 --> 00:15:25,105
What are you doing?

308
00:15:27,865 --> 00:15:29,705
I'm returning to the palace now.

309
00:15:29,785 --> 00:15:31,865
I can see you part of the way. Let's go.

310
00:15:31,945 --> 00:15:34,225
I also need to return to
the Office on business.

311
00:15:34,305 --> 00:15:35,305
-Let's go.
-Wait.

312
00:15:36,025 --> 00:15:37,545
The palace and the Office

313
00:15:37,625 --> 00:15:39,785
are in opposite directions...

314
00:15:41,425 --> 00:15:42,705
Zhizhi, let's go.

315
00:15:42,785 --> 00:15:43,745
Don't forget your big sword.

316
00:15:43,825 --> 00:15:45,425
Mengmeng, take care of
yourself while I'm gone.

317
00:15:45,505 --> 00:15:46,545
And remember to write to me.

318
00:15:47,905 --> 00:15:49,465
Zhizhi, when I return,
I'll follow every formal betrothal rite

319
00:15:49,545 --> 00:15:50,865
and come to your home to
ask for your hand myself.

320
00:15:53,785 --> 00:15:55,065
At the execution ground that day,

321
00:15:55,145 --> 00:15:56,385
Gu Qin looked uneasy.

322
00:15:56,465 --> 00:15:57,905
He must have something to hide.

323
00:15:58,705 --> 00:15:59,985
Today, I want to see

324
00:16:00,065 --> 00:16:01,985
whether that cat's-eye
pendant is really here.

325
00:16:02,065 --> 00:16:03,425
Madam Chancellor,

326
00:16:03,505 --> 00:16:05,225
we're only trying to uncover the truth.

327
00:16:05,305 --> 00:16:07,465
If your spirit can hear us,

328
00:16:07,545 --> 00:16:09,505
please haunt the true
murderer and claim his life.

329
00:16:09,585 --> 00:16:13,065
Spirits above and spirits below,

330
00:16:13,145 --> 00:16:14,505
ancestors, protect us.

331
00:16:14,585 --> 00:16:15,745
Let this coffin open without trouble.

332
00:16:15,825 --> 00:16:16,985
Madam Chancellor,

333
00:16:17,065 --> 00:16:17,985
forgive us.

334
00:16:18,065 --> 00:16:19,705
Spirits above...

335
00:16:19,785 --> 00:16:21,025
We'll run out of time if we delay.

336
00:16:50,625 --> 00:16:51,905
Forgive us...

337
00:16:58,185 --> 00:16:59,665
Someone's coming, my lord.

338
00:16:59,745 --> 00:17:01,705
Just one last step. Hurry and search.

339
00:17:09,705 --> 00:17:10,825
Quickly.

340
00:18:05,385 --> 00:18:07,065
Chancellor, this...

341
00:18:29,145 --> 00:18:30,345
Starting tomorrow,

342
00:18:30,425 --> 00:18:32,185
send more monks to chant sutras for Madam.

343
00:18:32,265 --> 00:18:33,905
They are to chant around the clock

344
00:18:37,065 --> 00:18:38,465
so no wandering spirits

345
00:18:38,545 --> 00:18:39,625
disturb her.

346
00:18:40,265 --> 00:18:41,465
Yes.

347
00:19:25,705 --> 00:19:27,305
Your Majesty.

348
00:19:27,385 --> 00:19:30,385
The Right Chancellor claimed his cat's-eye
pendant was buried with his late wife.

349
00:19:30,465 --> 00:19:32,225
But Yin Qing and I opened
the coffin to inspect it

350
00:19:32,305 --> 00:19:33,145
and found no trace of it.

351
00:19:34,345 --> 00:19:35,545
More suspicious still,

352
00:19:35,625 --> 00:19:37,145
he sent men to check the
grave that very night.

353
00:19:37,225 --> 00:19:38,905
That proves he has something to hide.

354
00:19:41,345 --> 00:19:43,465
The Right Chancellor's act
of being a devoted husband

355
00:19:43,545 --> 00:19:44,705
is quite convincing.

356
00:19:47,345 --> 00:19:49,425
But even if we expose his lie now,

357
00:19:50,025 --> 00:19:51,065
we still have no hard evidence.

358
00:19:51,145 --> 00:19:53,545
He was the hidden protector
behind Ling Yunfei.

359
00:19:53,625 --> 00:19:55,465
We still cannot touch him.

360
00:19:55,545 --> 00:19:56,625
I considered that too.

361
00:19:57,465 --> 00:19:58,865
If I confront him,

362
00:19:58,945 --> 00:20:00,425
he can simply claim the cat's-eye pendant

363
00:20:00,505 --> 00:20:01,945
was stolen by grave robbers.

364
00:20:02,025 --> 00:20:03,265
Then we still couldn't do anything to him.

365
00:20:03,345 --> 00:20:05,865
I want to use purging corruption
from court as our pretext.

366
00:20:05,945 --> 00:20:07,465
On the surface, we'll
investigate all officials.

367
00:20:08,025 --> 00:20:11,025
In truth, we'll focus on clues
tied to the Right Chancellor.

368
00:20:11,105 --> 00:20:12,385
What I want

369
00:20:12,465 --> 00:20:14,105
is not merely to expose one lie,

370
00:20:14,665 --> 00:20:16,065
but to make sure that in this court,

371
00:20:16,145 --> 00:20:17,425
no one dares deceive the Emperor again.

372
00:20:18,545 --> 00:20:21,145
Your Majesty is killing
two birds with one stone.

373
00:20:25,185 --> 00:20:26,025
What happened to your hand?

374
00:20:27,825 --> 00:20:30,105
I may have knocked it
while opening the coffin.

375
00:20:30,185 --> 00:20:31,505
It's nothing.

376
00:20:31,585 --> 00:20:33,345
Is the Light Cavalry I assigned
you merely for show?

377
00:20:33,425 --> 00:20:35,225
For something like entering
a tomb and opening a coffin,

378
00:20:35,305 --> 00:20:37,545
only Yin Qing was
suitable to accompany me.

379
00:20:37,625 --> 00:20:38,665
Why mobilize the Light Cavalry?

380
00:20:39,385 --> 00:20:40,545
I'll apply medicine for you.

381
00:20:40,625 --> 00:20:41,505
Your Majesty.

382
00:20:49,105 --> 00:20:49,945
Your Majesty.

383
00:20:50,545 --> 00:20:51,465
What is it?

384
00:20:51,545 --> 00:20:54,625
I saw you staying up late reading again.

385
00:20:54,705 --> 00:20:56,025
Your health has been poor.

386
00:20:56,105 --> 00:20:58,145
I'm truly worried about
Your Majesty's health.

387
00:20:58,225 --> 00:21:00,225
So I specially prepared

388
00:21:00,305 --> 00:21:01,865
a bowl of restorative tonic for you.

389
00:21:12,065 --> 00:21:13,905
Your Majesty, what is it now?

390
00:21:16,345 --> 00:21:18,465
I've been staying up late
reading these past few days,

391
00:21:19,345 --> 00:21:20,345
and my health is indeed suffering.

392
00:21:20,905 --> 00:21:22,985
I really do need that
restorative tonic of yours.

393
00:21:24,745 --> 00:21:25,785
Your Majesty.

394
00:21:41,425 --> 00:21:43,345
Staying up late to read

395
00:21:43,425 --> 00:21:44,585
will harm Your Majesty's health.

396
00:21:44,665 --> 00:21:46,265
After drinking the tonic

397
00:21:46,345 --> 00:21:48,105
I prepared especially for you,

398
00:21:48,185 --> 00:21:49,385
please retire early.

399
00:21:50,065 --> 00:21:51,145
You may withdraw.

400
00:21:51,745 --> 00:21:52,945
I take my leave.

401
00:22:13,945 --> 00:22:14,785
Has he gone?

402
00:22:15,865 --> 00:22:17,665
Lord Meng is usually so bold.

403
00:22:18,185 --> 00:22:19,385
Why so timid now?

404
00:22:19,465 --> 00:22:21,305
The moment I hear Chief
Steward You's voice,

405
00:22:21,905 --> 00:22:23,225
I panic for no reason.

406
00:22:23,305 --> 00:22:24,745
Just now, Your Majesty

407
00:22:25,465 --> 00:22:26,625
was no different from me.

408
00:22:33,105 --> 00:22:35,425
I rarely see you like this.

409
00:22:35,505 --> 00:22:36,705
You're laughing, Your Majesty?

410
00:22:38,505 --> 00:22:40,225
I've just dug up a grave
and opened a coffin,

411
00:22:40,305 --> 00:22:41,985
and now I'm hiding behind books.

412
00:22:42,065 --> 00:22:43,825
We hide our private affairs

413
00:22:43,905 --> 00:22:45,225
and conceal our official ones.

414
00:22:48,985 --> 00:22:50,385
Being with Your Majesty

415
00:22:51,465 --> 00:22:53,585
compared with investigating
corrupt officials,

416
00:22:53,665 --> 00:22:55,145
is even more nerve-racking.

417
00:23:00,185 --> 00:23:01,985
You may be afraid,

418
00:23:02,065 --> 00:23:03,505
but I like it.

419
00:23:31,385 --> 00:23:32,225
Director Meng.

420
00:23:34,465 --> 00:23:35,985
We found plenty.

421
00:23:36,065 --> 00:23:37,345
Guess what happened.

422
00:23:37,425 --> 00:23:39,185
Deputy Director Yin looks delighted.

423
00:23:39,265 --> 00:23:40,705
You must have found quite a lot.

424
00:23:41,345 --> 00:23:42,345
Let's hear it.

425
00:23:42,425 --> 00:23:44,345
Vice Minister of Revenue
Li Xin embezzled funds.

426
00:23:44,425 --> 00:23:46,225
He put all his ill-gotten
wealth in his wife's hands.

427
00:23:46,305 --> 00:23:48,105
But behind his back,

428
00:23:48,185 --> 00:23:51,065
she kept several young lovers.

429
00:23:51,145 --> 00:23:53,305
I'll surrender this mansion,
the only property I acquired illegally,

430
00:23:53,385 --> 00:23:54,745
to the Office immediately.

431
00:23:54,825 --> 00:23:56,345
As you can see, the place is empty.

432
00:23:56,425 --> 00:23:58,745
I haven't hidden a single
coin of the stolen money.

433
00:23:58,825 --> 00:24:00,345
Lord Yin, surely you can see...

434
00:24:01,905 --> 00:24:03,185
-Husband!
-You wretch!

435
00:24:03,265 --> 00:24:04,585
-Husband!
-You used my money

436
00:24:04,665 --> 00:24:05,585
to keep these beasts!

437
00:24:05,665 --> 00:24:06,985
Lord Li, this has nothing to do with me!

438
00:24:07,065 --> 00:24:09,545
-It has nothing to do with me!
-You dared become her kept man?

439
00:24:09,625 --> 00:24:10,665
There's more.

440
00:24:10,745 --> 00:24:12,105
The wife of Director Zhang
from the Ministry of Justice

441
00:24:12,185 --> 00:24:14,025
filed a formal complaint with the Office.

442
00:24:14,105 --> 00:24:16,705
Her husband keeps twelve mistresses.

443
00:24:16,785 --> 00:24:19,105
Apparently, more than half of them

444
00:24:19,185 --> 00:24:20,705
are women from Wanxiang House,

445
00:24:20,785 --> 00:24:22,705
sent by Liu Ruyan to serve Director Zhang.

446
00:24:22,785 --> 00:24:24,705
They only care about
his money, not the man,

447
00:24:24,785 --> 00:24:26,185
and get along like real sisters.

448
00:24:26,265 --> 00:24:27,505
As long as there's enough money,

449
00:24:27,585 --> 00:24:29,025
there's no need to fight over him.

450
00:24:29,105 --> 00:24:31,425
Then there's Hanlin Compiler Chen Jingyi.

451
00:24:31,985 --> 00:24:34,145
She's educated, courteous and gentle,

452
00:24:34,225 --> 00:24:36,145
and highly regarded by the
senior Secretariat officials.

453
00:24:37,145 --> 00:24:39,025
How could she be involved
in such a scandal?

454
00:24:39,825 --> 00:24:40,865
I'm nearly seventy.

455
00:24:40,945 --> 00:24:43,305
How could I do anything so vile?

456
00:24:43,385 --> 00:24:46,185
This is outrageous!

457
00:24:53,785 --> 00:24:54,625
Don't be afraid.

458
00:24:55,705 --> 00:24:57,905
If you don't speak up now,
you may never get another chance.

459
00:25:00,505 --> 00:25:02,345
Don't be afraid. Speak up.

460
00:25:07,145 --> 00:25:08,585
It was you.

461
00:25:08,665 --> 00:25:10,825
You used your position
to make indecent advances toward me.

462
00:25:11,545 --> 00:25:12,785
Then you threatened my career

463
00:25:12,865 --> 00:25:13,905
to force me into silence,

464
00:25:14,945 --> 00:25:18,185
saying you'd make sure
I had no place in the capital.

465
00:25:19,465 --> 00:25:20,585
I believe among all of you

466
00:25:20,665 --> 00:25:22,625
there must be others like me

467
00:25:22,705 --> 00:25:25,465
female officials who have suffered
at Academician Jiang's hands.

468
00:25:25,545 --> 00:25:27,545
Will you stand with me?

469
00:25:38,785 --> 00:25:40,265
If everyone stays silent,

470
00:25:41,385 --> 00:25:42,265
we allow this kind of

471
00:25:42,345 --> 00:25:44,305
sanctimonious predator to walk free.

472
00:25:44,825 --> 00:25:46,025
Then

473
00:25:46,105 --> 00:25:48,025
more women will suffer in the future.

474
00:25:49,025 --> 00:25:50,025
As female officials,

475
00:25:50,585 --> 00:25:51,865
our path is difficult enough already.

476
00:25:52,945 --> 00:25:55,105
We cannot let this vile
conduct spread unchecked.

477
00:25:56,705 --> 00:25:57,545
It was you.

478
00:25:57,625 --> 00:25:59,865
You abused your position
to make indecent advances toward me.

479
00:26:00,745 --> 00:26:01,745
Yes, you.

480
00:26:01,825 --> 00:26:03,025
You did it to me too.

481
00:26:03,105 --> 00:26:04,545
You violated me too.

482
00:26:04,625 --> 00:26:05,465
Take him away.

483
00:26:06,345 --> 00:26:07,185
Why are you arresting me?

484
00:26:07,265 --> 00:26:09,385
-Move.
-Why are you arresting me?

485
00:26:09,465 --> 00:26:10,585
We also discovered

486
00:26:10,665 --> 00:26:12,545
the Ministry of Personnel
has been selling offices.

487
00:26:12,625 --> 00:26:13,985
For now, however,

488
00:26:14,065 --> 00:26:15,985
it appears to be the secret work
of lower-ranking officials

489
00:26:16,065 --> 00:26:17,825
and has not yet implicated
senior ministers.

490
00:26:23,825 --> 00:26:25,625
All Personnel Ministry officials
involved in selling posts

491
00:26:25,705 --> 00:26:27,265
are suspended immediately
pending investigation.

492
00:26:27,345 --> 00:26:28,745
Take them away.

493
00:26:28,825 --> 00:26:30,305
-What's going on?
-Ah...

494
00:26:30,385 --> 00:26:31,585
Move.

495
00:26:31,665 --> 00:26:33,385
-Move! Hurry!
-Why are you arresting me?

496
00:26:33,465 --> 00:26:36,585
So far, we've only caught a few small fry.

497
00:26:36,665 --> 00:26:39,025
The big fish behind Ling Yunfei

498
00:26:39,785 --> 00:26:41,225
is still lurking beneath the surface.

499
00:26:42,065 --> 00:26:43,265
We need to stir up this entire pond

500
00:26:43,985 --> 00:26:45,665
until it's completely turned upside down.

501
00:26:46,985 --> 00:26:47,825
Only in muddy water...

502
00:26:48,545 --> 00:26:49,865
can we catch the fish.

503
00:26:53,825 --> 00:26:56,705
I, Vice Minister of Works Pan Wenhai,

504
00:26:56,785 --> 00:26:57,865
on behalf of the assembled ministers,

505
00:26:57,945 --> 00:27:01,145
impeach Meng Tinghui of the Office
for exceeding her authority

506
00:27:01,865 --> 00:27:04,545
and prying deeply into the private affairs
of senior court officials,

507
00:27:04,625 --> 00:27:07,465
causing outrage throughout the court

508
00:27:07,545 --> 00:27:08,785
and widespread fear.

509
00:27:10,225 --> 00:27:12,785
It is rare to see all
my ministers so united.

510
00:27:13,305 --> 00:27:14,425
I am greatly pleased.

511
00:27:14,505 --> 00:27:16,865
If the Office has truly
acted so outrageously,

512
00:27:16,945 --> 00:27:19,545
you may report its misconduct directly.

513
00:27:19,625 --> 00:27:21,065
Expose any corruption

514
00:27:21,145 --> 00:27:22,145
or abuse of law committed there.

515
00:27:23,025 --> 00:27:24,505
I will show no leniency.

516
00:27:31,465 --> 00:27:33,665
Do any of you have
anything else to report?

517
00:27:43,865 --> 00:27:46,105
My lords, don't be in
such a hurry to leave.

518
00:27:48,745 --> 00:27:50,345
The tea at the Office is getting cold.

519
00:27:51,865 --> 00:27:52,705
Please.

520
00:27:52,785 --> 00:27:54,825
We haven't broken any laws.

521
00:27:54,905 --> 00:27:56,265
How can you detain us at will?

522
00:27:56,345 --> 00:27:57,305
-Exactly.
-Right.

523
00:27:57,385 --> 00:27:58,585
What gives you the right to arrest us?

524
00:27:58,665 --> 00:28:01,385
Because you fabricated accusations

525
00:28:01,465 --> 00:28:02,785
and maliciously impeached the Office.

526
00:28:02,865 --> 00:28:04,585
I can therefore detain you

527
00:28:04,665 --> 00:28:05,745
for twelve hours on charges
of false accusation.

528
00:28:06,305 --> 00:28:07,425
-Take them away.
-Yes.

529
00:28:07,505 --> 00:28:10,385
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

530
00:28:12,265 --> 00:28:14,145
Your Majesty, please see the truth!

531
00:28:14,225 --> 00:28:15,385
Your Majesty!

532
00:28:16,345 --> 00:28:17,785
Meng Tinghui twists right and wrong

533
00:28:17,865 --> 00:28:19,025
and frames loyal officials!

534
00:28:19,105 --> 00:28:20,705
-Your Majesty!
-Move.

535
00:28:21,385 --> 00:28:22,225
Quickly.

536
00:28:23,625 --> 00:28:24,705
Meng Tinghui!

537
00:28:24,785 --> 00:28:27,305
What right have you to detain us here?

538
00:28:27,385 --> 00:28:29,305
-Exactly!
-Yes, why?

539
00:28:29,385 --> 00:28:31,305
Why are you holding us here?

540
00:28:31,385 --> 00:28:32,225
Witch!

541
00:28:32,305 --> 00:28:34,225
Unless you kill me,

542
00:28:34,305 --> 00:28:36,345
I'll submit a memorial every day

543
00:28:36,425 --> 00:28:37,785
to impeach a treacherous
official like you!

544
00:28:37,865 --> 00:28:39,665
-Exactly!
-Yes!

545
00:28:39,745 --> 00:28:42,265
You are the Daji of this court,

546
00:28:42,985 --> 00:28:44,185
a curse without end!

547
00:28:44,265 --> 00:28:46,625
The court's Daji, a curse without end!

548
00:28:46,705 --> 00:28:47,585
A curse without end!

549
00:28:47,665 --> 00:28:49,745
-Witch!
-Get out of the court!

550
00:28:49,825 --> 00:28:52,105
I refuse to serve alongside you.

551
00:29:00,665 --> 00:29:03,105
I merely invited all you ministers

552
00:29:03,185 --> 00:29:05,305
to the Office for a cup of tea.

553
00:29:06,625 --> 00:29:08,145
Why get so worked up?

554
00:29:08,625 --> 00:29:10,665
We will never drink tea served by

555
00:29:10,745 --> 00:29:12,065
a treacherous official like you!

556
00:29:12,145 --> 00:29:13,785
-Exactly!
-Right!

557
00:29:13,865 --> 00:29:15,505
We won't drink your tea!

558
00:29:15,585 --> 00:29:17,465
Witch, get out of the court!

559
00:29:17,545 --> 00:29:19,585
During last autumn's
provincial examination,

560
00:29:19,665 --> 00:29:22,025
Academician Lin accepted
bribes from candidates

561
00:29:22,665 --> 00:29:24,945
and altered thirteen exam papers.

562
00:29:25,025 --> 00:29:26,545
Three of those candidates

563
00:29:26,625 --> 00:29:27,745
could barely write a coherent sentence,

564
00:29:27,825 --> 00:29:30,345
while true scholars who
studied for ten years failed.

565
00:29:31,105 --> 00:29:32,665
One even coughed blood
and collapsed on the spot.

566
00:29:32,745 --> 00:29:34,065
Send him to the Court of Judicial Review

567
00:29:34,945 --> 00:29:35,945
for punishment according to law.

568
00:29:36,025 --> 00:29:36,905
Meng Tinghui!

569
00:29:36,985 --> 00:29:38,505
You... you're using public office
for a private vendetta!

570
00:29:38,585 --> 00:29:40,185
Yin Qing.

571
00:29:40,265 --> 00:29:42,105
-I demand to see His Majesty!
-Director Meng.

572
00:29:42,185 --> 00:29:43,545
-Meng Tinghui!
-During the heavy rains early this year,

573
00:29:44,145 --> 00:29:46,105
Minister of Works Pan Wenhai

574
00:29:46,185 --> 00:29:47,985
used repairs to the
river dikes as a pretext

575
00:29:48,065 --> 00:29:50,905
to embezzle nearly 100,000 taels
of disaster-relief funds.

576
00:29:50,985 --> 00:29:52,385
Six downstream villages were destroyed,

577
00:29:52,465 --> 00:29:54,425
with countless people killed or injured.

578
00:29:54,505 --> 00:29:57,345
Yet only three days after the disaster,

579
00:29:57,425 --> 00:29:58,985
he purchased a thousand
mu of prime farmland.

580
00:29:59,865 --> 00:30:01,945
-A thou...
-A thousand mu?

581
00:30:02,025 --> 00:30:03,225
Nonsense!

582
00:30:03,305 --> 00:30:05,825
-Utter lies!
-Here is the evidence of his embezzlement.

583
00:30:11,985 --> 00:30:12,825
You...

584
00:30:12,905 --> 00:30:14,105
You even dared steal
disaster-relief money?

585
00:30:14,905 --> 00:30:16,705
Send him and the evidence
to the Ministry of Justice.

586
00:30:16,785 --> 00:30:18,705
Remember to remind the Minister

587
00:30:19,265 --> 00:30:22,545
that under the Laws of Daning,
this case carries the highest penalty.

588
00:30:23,385 --> 00:30:24,585
I've been framed!

589
00:30:24,665 --> 00:30:26,065
Nonsense!

590
00:30:26,145 --> 00:30:27,665
Utter nonsense!

591
00:30:27,745 --> 00:30:28,585
Lord Pan.

592
00:30:32,105 --> 00:30:32,945
Next.

593
00:30:33,745 --> 00:30:34,865
Meng Tinghui!

594
00:30:35,465 --> 00:30:37,185
You abuse public office for private ends

595
00:30:37,265 --> 00:30:38,825
and attack anyone outside your faction.

596
00:30:38,905 --> 00:30:40,345
His Majesty must have lost his senses

597
00:30:40,425 --> 00:30:42,225
to place such favor in you alone!

598
00:30:42,305 --> 00:30:43,545
-Exactly!
-Exactly!

599
00:30:43,625 --> 00:30:45,265
-Witch!
-Why?

600
00:30:45,345 --> 00:30:46,465
Silence!

601
00:31:16,265 --> 00:31:17,505
His Majesty's decisions

602
00:31:17,585 --> 00:31:18,705
are not yours to criticize.

603
00:31:19,625 --> 00:31:21,945
The Right Chancellor himself
honors the Office with a visit.

604
00:31:22,025 --> 00:31:22,945
Forgive us for not welcoming you sooner.

605
00:31:24,105 --> 00:31:24,945
I hope you'll pardon us.

606
00:31:28,705 --> 00:31:30,425
Everyone says the Office
serves terrible tea.

607
00:31:31,105 --> 00:31:32,785
I thought I'd come taste it myself.

608
00:31:34,745 --> 00:31:35,585
Director Meng.

609
00:31:37,305 --> 00:31:39,105
Would you spare me a cup?

610
00:31:48,425 --> 00:31:49,625
Right Chancellor.

611
00:31:49,705 --> 00:31:50,545
Please.

612
00:31:55,545 --> 00:31:57,465
The Office has recently
been purging corruption.

613
00:31:57,545 --> 00:31:59,185
As head of the civil officials,

614
00:31:59,945 --> 00:32:01,545
and one whom the realm flatters
as a virtuous chancellor,

615
00:32:02,585 --> 00:32:04,265
I should naturally set
an example for the court

616
00:32:04,345 --> 00:32:05,785
and cooperate willingly
with your investigation.

617
00:32:08,105 --> 00:32:08,985
Right Chancellor.

618
00:32:09,065 --> 00:32:11,705
I heard Pan Wenhai and Academician Lin

619
00:32:11,785 --> 00:32:12,745
were both your students.

620
00:32:12,825 --> 00:32:14,145
Director Meng, mind your words.

621
00:32:16,985 --> 00:32:19,105
We are all servants of the court.

622
00:32:19,185 --> 00:32:21,505
We receive the sovereign's salary
and must serve him faithfully.

623
00:32:22,145 --> 00:32:24,945
Even if close followers or
old friends break the law,

624
00:32:25,905 --> 00:32:27,065
I will never shield them.

625
00:32:29,305 --> 00:32:31,305
The Right Chancellor is truly principled.

626
00:32:31,865 --> 00:32:33,385
Speaking of close followers and old ties,

627
00:32:33,945 --> 00:32:35,865
does the Gu family have
any collateral branches?

628
00:32:38,385 --> 00:32:39,905
I was born into a humble family.

629
00:32:39,985 --> 00:32:41,625
I am the Gu family's only male heir

630
00:32:41,705 --> 00:32:42,585
and the one who restored its standing.

631
00:32:42,665 --> 00:32:44,465
Director Meng may
investigate as she pleases.

632
00:32:44,545 --> 00:32:47,105
I only ask that you enforce
the law impartially,

633
00:32:47,185 --> 00:32:48,065
neither framing the innocent
nor sparing the guilty.

634
00:32:48,145 --> 00:32:50,985
I am willing to let Director
Meng's investigation

635
00:32:51,065 --> 00:32:51,905
prove my loyalty and integrity.

636
00:32:51,985 --> 00:32:53,745
Right Chancellor,

637
00:32:53,825 --> 00:32:56,145
are you truly not worried
about what we may uncover?

638
00:32:56,225 --> 00:32:58,705
I have always conducted myself uprightly.

639
00:32:58,785 --> 00:32:59,705
I fear no investigation.

640
00:33:00,345 --> 00:33:02,585
These are the account books
for my salary over the years.

641
00:33:03,945 --> 00:33:05,065
Please examine them as you wish.

642
00:33:06,305 --> 00:33:08,385
Since the Right Chancellor is so open,

643
00:33:09,225 --> 00:33:10,825
you must surely be beyond suspicion.

644
00:33:11,465 --> 00:33:14,185
so there's no need to investigate further.

645
00:33:15,265 --> 00:33:17,905
The Right Chancellor once
helped advance my career.

646
00:33:17,985 --> 00:33:19,945
I have complete faith that he is

647
00:33:20,025 --> 00:33:21,465
honest and incorruptible.

648
00:33:22,345 --> 00:33:23,185
Come.

649
00:33:34,545 --> 00:33:36,945
Who says the Office's tea is bad?

650
00:33:37,545 --> 00:33:39,145
I find it quite delicious.

651
00:33:41,105 --> 00:33:42,945
My lords, remain calm.

652
00:33:43,025 --> 00:33:45,025
Come and taste the tea with me.

653
00:33:45,585 --> 00:33:47,105
We are all colleagues.

654
00:33:47,905 --> 00:33:50,225
We should fully cooperate
with Director Meng.

655
00:33:50,305 --> 00:33:51,505
-Yes.
-Yes.

656
00:33:56,785 --> 00:33:59,025
That Meng Tinghui is like a rabid dog.

657
00:33:59,105 --> 00:34:01,065
She's thrown all Six
Ministries into chaos.

658
00:34:01,585 --> 00:34:03,025
Pan Wenhai and Academician Lin

659
00:34:03,105 --> 00:34:04,745
are already panicking.

660
00:34:04,825 --> 00:34:06,065
If she keeps digging like this, then...

661
00:34:06,145 --> 00:34:08,025
Since Meng Tinghui wants
to purge the court,

662
00:34:08,585 --> 00:34:10,745
I should naturally cooperate.

663
00:34:15,065 --> 00:34:15,945
Perhaps...

664
00:34:16,985 --> 00:34:18,385
we should give her a few heads.

665
00:34:21,825 --> 00:34:22,665
My lord.

666
00:34:22,745 --> 00:34:24,745
They have been utterly loyal to you.

667
00:34:24,825 --> 00:34:26,505
If the fishing net is cast too tightly,

668
00:34:26,585 --> 00:34:28,665
you must let a few
small fish slip through.

669
00:34:28,745 --> 00:34:29,745
Lord Pan

670
00:34:29,825 --> 00:34:31,505
is especially fond of buying
land and estates, isn't he?

671
00:34:33,905 --> 00:34:35,465
Have someone leak that to Meng Tinghui.

672
00:34:36,145 --> 00:34:37,705
How much she manages to uncover

673
00:34:39,625 --> 00:34:41,305
will depend on her ability.

674
00:34:49,545 --> 00:34:51,025
Right Chancellor, when it comes
to the Office's work,

675
00:34:51,105 --> 00:34:52,505
you have given us such strong support.

676
00:34:53,105 --> 00:34:54,945
I am deeply grateful.

677
00:34:56,905 --> 00:34:57,825
In that case,

678
00:34:57,905 --> 00:34:59,185
I won't impose any longer.

679
00:34:59,265 --> 00:35:00,825
Director Meng, if you
encounter any difficulty,

680
00:35:01,345 --> 00:35:03,745
send someone to my residence at any time.

681
00:35:05,465 --> 00:35:07,545
Director Meng, I'll see my teacher out.

682
00:35:13,345 --> 00:35:14,545
Director.

683
00:35:14,665 --> 00:35:16,825
The Right Chancellor
clearly came prepared.

684
00:35:16,905 --> 00:35:18,225
How should we respond?

685
00:35:18,305 --> 00:35:19,785
The more he puts on this performance,

686
00:35:19,865 --> 00:35:21,305
the more guilty he looks.

687
00:35:21,385 --> 00:35:23,585
Since he wants to stage this play,

688
00:35:23,665 --> 00:35:25,145
we may as well play along.

689
00:35:25,225 --> 00:35:26,865
Gather and organize

690
00:35:26,945 --> 00:35:28,505
every case file concerning
the Right Chancellor.

691
00:35:28,585 --> 00:35:30,185
That old fox

692
00:35:30,665 --> 00:35:32,625
wants to use me to hold
up a mirror of virtue.

693
00:35:32,705 --> 00:35:34,505
I'd like to see

694
00:35:35,425 --> 00:35:37,945
whether that mirror reveals the truth

695
00:35:38,025 --> 00:35:40,145
or the blood staining his hands.

696
00:36:50,465 --> 00:36:52,305
The Blood Moon hangs high.

697
00:36:52,385 --> 00:36:53,945
The Black Bird returns.

698
00:36:54,025 --> 00:36:55,625
The Blood Moon hangs high.

699
00:36:55,705 --> 00:36:57,145
The Black Bird returns.

700
00:36:59,385 --> 00:37:00,945
A secret letter from Mr. Shangguan.

701
00:37:01,025 --> 00:37:03,745
Although we failed to take
Ying Gua's life this time,

702
00:37:03,825 --> 00:37:05,465
the Princess is now highly valued

703
00:37:05,545 --> 00:37:06,505
and risen swiftly through the ranks.

704
00:37:06,585 --> 00:37:08,145
May Heaven bless Zhongwan.

705
00:37:08,225 --> 00:37:10,025
May we reclaim our homeland.

706
00:37:10,105 --> 00:37:13,465
That dog Emperor seems unwilling
to form a marriage alliance with Beijian.

707
00:37:13,545 --> 00:37:15,105
Our Black Feather Guard has
successfully intercepted

708
00:37:15,185 --> 00:37:16,865
thirty thousand shi of
Daning military grain.

709
00:37:16,945 --> 00:37:18,505
Heaven has handed us
the perfect opportunity.

710
00:37:18,585 --> 00:37:21,825
In three days, I will go to Beijian myself

711
00:37:21,905 --> 00:37:23,105
to forge an alliance.

712
00:37:26,705 --> 00:37:29,665
Where the Blood Moon and
Black Feather blades point,

713
00:37:30,145 --> 00:37:33,305
Daning's realm will tremble.

714
00:37:33,385 --> 00:37:34,745
May Heaven bless Zhongwan.

715
00:37:34,825 --> 00:37:36,265
May we reclaim our homeland.

716
00:37:36,345 --> 00:37:38,145
May Heaven bless Zhongwan.

717
00:37:38,225 --> 00:37:39,465
May we reclaim our homeland.

718
00:38:51,825 --> 00:38:53,865
Yao'er, come catch me!

719
00:38:54,585 --> 00:38:55,865
Come on! Come on!

720
00:38:56,705 --> 00:38:58,305
Yao'er, come catch me!

721
00:38:59,105 --> 00:39:00,505
Brother Shangguan!

722
00:39:01,185 --> 00:39:02,465
Brother Shangguan!

723
00:39:03,265 --> 00:39:04,865
Brother Shangguan!

724
00:39:05,905 --> 00:39:07,545
Brother Shangguan!

725
00:39:09,105 --> 00:39:11,425
Brother Shangguan!

726
00:39:11,505 --> 00:39:13,665
Where did you go?

727
00:39:13,745 --> 00:39:15,865
Brother Shangguan!

728
00:39:16,385 --> 00:39:18,185
Brother Shangguan!

729
00:39:18,745 --> 00:39:20,865
Brother Shangguan!

730
00:39:21,625 --> 00:39:23,665
Brother Shangguan!

731
00:39:24,345 --> 00:39:25,705
Brother Shangguan!

732
00:39:26,785 --> 00:39:28,585
Brother Shangguan!

733
00:39:32,665 --> 00:39:34,385
Brother Shangguan!

734
00:40:19,545 --> 00:40:20,585
Leyan.

735
00:40:25,105 --> 00:40:26,905
Teacher, I've finished the painting.

736
00:40:32,425 --> 00:40:33,345
The brushwork is exquisite.

737
00:40:33,425 --> 00:40:34,385
But...

738
00:40:35,385 --> 00:40:36,385
it lacks a soul.

739
00:41:01,985 --> 00:41:03,305
Spring Comes Late.

740
00:41:04,025 --> 00:41:05,985
Last night brought tidings of spring.

741
00:41:06,065 --> 00:41:07,585
My heart rejoiced in secret,

742
00:41:07,665 --> 00:41:08,825
and quietly sent its springtime longing.

743
00:41:09,465 --> 00:41:10,905
Only spring knows spring's secrets.

744
00:41:11,585 --> 00:41:12,705
Is this Spring Comes Late?

745
00:41:14,265 --> 00:41:15,945
Since Lingyi died,

746
00:41:16,025 --> 00:41:17,465
every day has felt

747
00:41:17,545 --> 00:41:18,585
like walking on thin ice.

748
00:41:18,665 --> 00:41:20,545
The winter has been long,

749
00:41:20,625 --> 00:41:21,985
and spring seemed impossibly far away.

750
00:41:22,065 --> 00:41:23,345
But that day,

751
00:41:23,425 --> 00:41:25,265
when I laid down the dagger before you,

752
00:41:25,665 --> 00:41:26,905
I suddenly realized

753
00:41:27,945 --> 00:41:29,185
the dead are gone,

754
00:41:29,945 --> 00:41:32,625
and the living must live for themselves.

755
00:41:35,905 --> 00:41:36,745
Leyan.

756
00:41:37,545 --> 00:41:39,345
You gave me another chance at life.

757
00:41:39,905 --> 00:41:41,025
From now on,

758
00:41:41,105 --> 00:41:42,625
I want to live for myself once more.

759
00:41:44,665 --> 00:41:46,825
I'm so glad you can
think this way, Teacher.

760
00:41:46,905 --> 00:41:48,425
Some time ago,

761
00:41:48,905 --> 00:41:50,425
I saw how deeply you were grieving,

762
00:41:50,505 --> 00:41:52,745
yet you still helped Director
Meng purge corruption.

763
00:41:53,505 --> 00:41:55,065
While I admired you,

764
00:41:55,145 --> 00:41:56,385
I worried about you day and night.

765
00:41:57,185 --> 00:41:58,905
So I painted this spring scene

766
00:41:59,585 --> 00:42:00,665
and wanted to give it to you.

767
00:42:07,625 --> 00:42:08,465
Leyan.

768
00:42:08,545 --> 00:42:10,305
All of this is because of you.

769
00:42:11,425 --> 00:42:12,425
Only when I'm by your side

770
00:42:12,505 --> 00:42:14,545
can I truly be myself.

771
00:42:15,905 --> 00:42:17,585
I know teacher and student
must observe proper boundaries.

772
00:42:17,665 --> 00:42:19,945
The road ahead will be full of obstacles.

773
00:42:22,065 --> 00:42:23,345
But if I remain steadfast...

774
00:42:23,985 --> 00:42:25,145
Leyan.

775
00:42:25,225 --> 00:42:26,705
Would you be willing, for my sake,

776
00:42:27,625 --> 00:42:28,705
to be brave just once?

